  "description": "A workload needs an HDD-based EBS volume optimized for throughput during large sequential reads and writes. Which type should it consider first?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 096</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>96 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"96번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:89%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q096\" data-question=\"Q096\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q096</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload needs an HDD-based EBS volume optimized for throughput during large sequential reads and writes. Which type should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q096\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only io2</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q096\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">st1</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q096\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q096\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/#st1\">st1</a>은 처리량 최적화 HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span>다. 부팅 볼륨으로는 사용할 수 없다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href